{"2227410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LION The Last Homeland", "steam_appid": 2227410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>——————— Explore a World Doomed to Darkness ———————</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LION is an action-adventure game where the player controls Rosamunde, a woman who awakens in a world that is slowly but surely being consumed by darkness and demons.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/3899bd8ca738a702302a05aa4d39280a.poster.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/3899bd8ca738a702302a05aa4d39280a.webm?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/3899bd8ca738a702302a05aa4d39280a.mp4?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore this world collecting all 20 children, who act as both allies and weapons. You can send them to attack independently, use them to attack directly, or combine both approaches all mixed with tools scattered throughout the world that, once obtained, unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/c1c47801ce7035c17035747f5d459e92.poster.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/c1c47801ce7035c17035747f5d459e92.webm?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/c1c47801ce7035c17035747f5d459e92.mp4?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>---------------------------<strong><i>——————— Action RTS Hybrid Combat System ———————</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a regular hack-and-slash warrior or send the children to attack on your behalf. Each child possesses unique skills, weapon types, and elemental damage, organized in groups of 4 to 5. Some focus on melee combat, others on ranged combat, some on single targets while others specialize in crowd control — and all of this applies when they are used as weapons as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ceef123a4877631dbf63498de293e0cc.poster.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ceef123a4877631dbf63498de293e0cc.webm?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ceef123a4877631dbf63498de293e0cc.mp4?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>——————— Obtain New Tools and Rescue More Children to Access New Areas ———————</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each child type has their own unique traversal skills and tools, which must be used to access new areas of the world. Make the children work together to overcome obstacles and reach places you could not otherwise. Both their power and their number are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ac732d4733094a9a2c9a0f8b145befd3.poster.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ac732d4733094a9a2c9a0f8b145befd3.webm?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ac732d4733094a9a2c9a0f8b145befd3.mp4?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>——————— Explore Dangerous Dungeons with Deadly Enemies and Bosses ———————</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight dangerous enemies and deadly bosses lurking inside dungeons — these enemies and locations will push your skills to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/d968eaf9eb433f0bee5cf87dcffb72b3.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=228 /></span>---------------------<i><strong>Use ——————— Use Skill Crystals to Customize Your Playstyle ———————</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complementing all of this is the Skill Crystal system — designed to let players customize their combat style and adventure by changing parameters such as the children's AI, and by granting Rosamunde and the children unique combat abilities. Collect special Crystal Medals and equip them through the Inventory Menu.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>——————— Explore a World Doomed to Darkness ———————</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LION is an action-adventure game where the player controls Rosamunde, a woman who awakens in a world that is slowly but surely being consumed by darkness and demons.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/3899bd8ca738a702302a05aa4d39280a.poster.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/3899bd8ca738a702302a05aa4d39280a.webm?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/3899bd8ca738a702302a05aa4d39280a.mp4?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore this world collecting all 20 children, who act as both allies and weapons. You can send them to attack independently, use them to attack directly, or combine both approaches all mixed with tools scattered throughout the world that, once obtained, unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/c1c47801ce7035c17035747f5d459e92.poster.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/c1c47801ce7035c17035747f5d459e92.webm?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/c1c47801ce7035c17035747f5d459e92.mp4?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>---------------------------<strong><i>——————— Action RTS Hybrid Combat System ———————</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a regular hack-and-slash warrior or send the children to attack on your behalf. Each child possesses unique skills, weapon types, and elemental damage, organized in groups of 4 to 5. Some focus on melee combat, others on ranged combat, some on single targets while others specialize in crowd control — and all of this applies when they are used as weapons as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ceef123a4877631dbf63498de293e0cc.poster.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ceef123a4877631dbf63498de293e0cc.webm?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ceef123a4877631dbf63498de293e0cc.mp4?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>——————— Obtain New Tools and Rescue More Children to Access New Areas ———————</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each child type has their own unique traversal skills and tools, which must be used to access new areas of the world. Make the children work together to overcome obstacles and reach places you could not otherwise. Both their power and their number are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ac732d4733094a9a2c9a0f8b145befd3.poster.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ac732d4733094a9a2c9a0f8b145befd3.webm?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/ac732d4733094a9a2c9a0f8b145befd3.mp4?t=1786670524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>——————— Explore Dangerous Dungeons with Deadly Enemies and Bosses ———————</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight dangerous enemies and deadly bosses lurking inside dungeons — these enemies and locations will push your skills to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/extras/d968eaf9eb433f0bee5cf87dcffb72b3.avif?t=1786670524\" width=600 height=228 /></span>---------------------<i><strong>Use ——————— Use Skill Crystals to Customize Your Playstyle ———————</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complementing all of this is the Skill Crystal system — designed to let players customize their combat style and adventure by changing parameters such as the children's AI, and by granting Rosamunde and the children unique combat abilities. Collect special Crystal Medals and equip them through the Inventory Menu.</p>", "short_description": "A mother at the end of the world must rescue and command 20 powerful orphaned children to protect their last sanctuary in this Action Real-Time Tactical Metroidvania. Craft strategic attack plans for rapid commands, explore a decaying land, and defend your homeland from a relentless demonic invasion", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/f30c25036748368d318244a8b1b71d1209961edf/header.jpg?t=1786670524", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/c2208a64c4677ba76292eb44636344b0b958dc11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786670524", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2227410/c2208a64c4677ba76292eb44636344b0b958dc11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786670524", "website": "https://galramirez.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit OS required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA®GTX1650 or AMD Radeon™ or RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><s